# Automation Development and Documentation

## Development

This rule helps with the development process and testing of @moad_dots.sh and @./lib/**/* files:

Favor simplicity and portability during the development process.  The purpose of this repository is so that it can be shared amongst various systems.

## Documentation

This rule helps generate documentation:

When making architectural changes include documentation in the @READMD.md file.  Always include an updated example of the printed usage statement of @moar_dots.sh.

When new sections within the @README.md file, update the table of contents with links directly to the newly created section.  Ensure the ordering of the table of contents matches the ordering of the sections as they are written.
